(1463,	'Sakshi Arya',	'3123456780',	'W3speedx@gmail.com',	'Hey there! 👀\r\nWant to save time by eliminating manual speed score checks?\r\n\r\nIntroduce W3SpeedX—your free backstage buddy tracking your websites daily and shouting alerts when your score drops.\r\nIt watches your Core Web Vitals, logs performance metrics, delivers daily Google Page Speed scores, and keeps track of past trends so you can fix issues before they break stuff.\r\n\r\nHere is what it brings to the table every day:\r\n✅ Real-time performance tracking\r\n✅ Detailed reports & customizable dashboards\r\n✅ Score drop alerts (like, “Hey! Your homepage got lazy today!”)\r\n✅ Multi-website monitoring\r\n✅ Free plan available – Monitor up to 5 websites (5 URLs of each) for free – yes, we said free\r\n✅ Daily performance scores based on Google Page Speed Insights (so you don’t have to run that test 100 times)\r\n✅ Check historical data for previous dates after adding your site\r\n\r\n🔗 Click https://w3speedx.com/  before your CLS shifts again. 😅\r\nP.S. Got more than 5 URLs to stalk? We’ve got custom plans ready for you.\r\nYour website deserves better, and so do your users.\r\nTry W3SpeedX. Recommend W3SpeedX. Obsess over W3SpeedX.\r\nOr pretend you didn’t scroll past this, and we’ll pretend not to notice.',	'2025-04-30 13:29:45',	'2025-04-30 13:29:45'),
