outube.com/embed/HfydOPWdgnE\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture\" allowfullscreen=\"\">\r\n</iframe>\r\n\r\n\r\n</p>',	'1',	'2021-05-10 02:47:11',	'2025-06-06 04:03:13',	'gurpreetBMP',	'Best Music Production & Sound Engineering Course for Students in Punjab | Gurpreet BMP',	'Best Music Production & Sound Engineering Course for Students in Punjab',	'<p>Searching for Music Production or Sound Engineering Courses in Punjab?Here’s how Gurpreet Singh, a passionate music producer from Punjab, turned his dream into reality with professional training at Crypto Cipher Academy, Delhi.</p>',	2.00),
(4,	'2018',	'Gaurav Kapoor',	'Freelancer |  Music Producer | Sample Library Developer | Music Composer | Creative Media Producer',	'1042614309.png',	'<p>Gaurav Kapoor enrolled in Sound Engineering Diploma in 2018 and now working as a Freelancer |  Music Producer | Sample Library Developer | Music Composer | Creative Media Producer</p>',	'<p class=\"p1\" style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 12px; line-height: normal; font-family: Helvetica;\">Gaurav Kapoor enrolled in Sound Engineering Diploma in 2018 and now working as a Freelancer |<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span>Music Producer | Sample Library Developer | Music Composer | Creative Media Producer. He delivers full track work along with complete video. His work is unique and professional which includes idea generation of Video &amp; Audio , production/ Arrangements , Mixing &amp; Mastering resulting in complete finished product.<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 12px; line-height: normal; font-family: Helvetica;\">He is also working as Sample Library Developer and has started his own online store -&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.gksbeatstore.com/\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.gksbeatstore.com/</a></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 12px; line-height: normal; font-family: Helvetica;\"><br></p><p><br><iframe width=\"100%\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/BBzqm5a_RLY\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture\" allowfullscreen=\"\"></iframe></p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<iframe width=\"100%\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/yfuWq3j7e-A\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture\" allowfullscreen=\"\"></iframe>',	NULL,	NULL,	NULL,	'<p><img src=\"data:image/jpeg;base64,\" style=\"width: 100%;\" data-filename=\"Gaurav Kapoor.jpg\"><br></p>',	'1',	'2022-06-10 11:58:41',	'2025-06-06 04:04:59',	'GauravKapoor',	'Gaurav Kapoor | Music Production & Sound Engineering Student',	'Music Production Jobs',	'<p>Gaurav Kapoor enrolled in Sound Engineering Diploma in 2018 and now working as a Freelancer |  Music Producer | Sample Library Developer | Music Composer | Creative Media Producer. He delivers full track work along with complete video. His work is unique and professional which includes idea generation of Video &amp; Audio , production/ Arrangements , Mixing &amp; Mastering resulting in complete finished product</p>',	5.00),
