(9,	'2018',	'Sagar Shrivastava',	'Freelancer | Music Producer | Music Composer | Singer |',	'1735262338.png',	'<p>Sagar enrolled in Sound Engineering Diploma in 2018 and now working as a Freelancer | Music Producer | Music Composer | Singer |</p><p>He is doing freelance music production for some independent artists and also producing his own original songs.</p><div><br></div>',	'<p><br></p><iframe width=\"100%\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/DCy18A2YYds\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture\" allowfullscreen=\"\"></iframe>\r\n<iframe width=\"100%\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/cIcr6TiHfZU\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture\" allowfullscreen=\"\"></iframe>\r\n<iframe width=\"100%\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/69MJgYLmjnA\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture\" allowfullscreen=\"\"></iframe>',	NULL,	NULL,	NULL,	NULL,	'1',	'2022-06-23 12:24:49',	'2025-06-06 04:07:44',	'Sagarshrivastava',	'Sagar | Music Production & Sound Engineering Student',	'Music Production Jobs',	'<p><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 15.5467px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">Sagar enrolled in Sound Engineering Diploma in 2018 and now working as a&nbsp;</span></span>Freelancer | Music Producer | Music Composer | Singer |</p><p>He is doing freelance music production for some independent artists and also producing his own original songs.</p>',	15.00),
(10,	'2018',	'Piyush ( LazerX Music )',	'Hollywood & Bollywood Music Projects  | Music Producer | Music Composer',	'549473144.png',	'<p><br></p><p><span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\"><b>Lazer X</b>, the stage name of Punjabi rapper-producer Piyush Trehan enrolled in <b>Crypto Cipher</b></span><b>®&nbsp;</b><span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\"><b>Sound Engineering Diploma</b> 2018, is a dynamic force in India\'s contemporary music landscape.</span> <span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\">His innovative fusion of experimental hip-hop, Punjabi folk, and global sounds has earned him recognition across both <b>Bollywood and Hollywood</b>.</span></p><h3 data-start=\"119\" data-end=\"162\">Hollywood Breakthrough: <em data-start=\"150\" data-end=\"162\">Monkey Man</em></h3><p>\r\n</p><p data-start=\"164\" data-end=\"361\"><span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\">Lazer X\'s international acclaim surged with the inclusion of his track “Naam Mera” in Dev Patel’s directorial debut, <em data-start=\"117\" data-end=\"129\">Monkey Man</em> (2024).</span> <span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\">This gritty, high-energy song, produced in collaboration with Sneha Khanwalkar, complements the film\'s intense narrative.</span> <span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\">The opportunity arose from a remix challenge hosted by Khanwalkar’s company, SoundCake, where Lazer X\'s submission caught her attention, leading to their collaboration on the film\'s soundtrack</span></p><h3 data-start=\"368\" data-end=\"404\">Bollywood &amp; OTT Contributions</h3><p data-start=\"406\" data-end=\"524\"><span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\">Beyond Hollywood, Lazer X has made significant strides in Indian cinema and streaming platforms.</span> <span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\">His notable works include:</span></p><p data-start=\"164\" data-end=\"361\"><span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\">\r\n\r\n</span></p><ul data-start=\"526\" data-end=\"734\">\r\n<li data-start=\"526\" data-end=\"567\">\r\n<p data-start=\"528\" data-end=\"567\"><span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\">“Darr Nu Daraa” featuring the Nooran Sisters, produced by Sneha Khanwalkar.</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"568\" data-end=\"609\">\r\n<p data-start=\"570\" data-end=\"609\"><span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\">“Uncle Ji” from the film <em data-start=\"25\" data-end=\"39\">Mister Mummy</em>.</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"610\" data-end=\"651\">\r\n<p data-start=\"612\" data-end=\"651\"><span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\">“Ye Luthrey” for <em data-start=\"17\" data-end=\"35\">Sharmaji Namkeen</em>.</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"652\" data-end=\"734\">\r\n<p data-start=\"654\" data-end=\"734\"><span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\">“Jorr” featured in <em data-start=\"19\" data-end=\"28\">Undekhi</em> Season 3 on Sony LIV</span></p></li></ul>',	'<p>Lazer X\'s international acclaim surged with the inclusion of his track “Naam Mera” in Dev Patel’s directorial debut, Monkey Man (2024). This gritty, high-energy song, produced in collaboration with Sneha Khanwalkar, complements the film\'s intense narrative. The opportunity arose from a remix challenge hosted by Khanwalkar’s company, SoundCake, where Lazer X\'s submission caught her attention, leading to their collaboration on the film\'s soundtrack\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p></p>\r\n\r\n<p><iframe width=\"100%\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/g8zxiB5Qhsc?si=l_v3BDCgFUfzpPml\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen=\"\"></iframe></p>\r\n\r\nBeyond Hollywood, Lazer X has made significant strides in Indian cinema and streaming platforms. His notable works include:\r\n\r\n“Darr Nu Daraa” featuring the Nooran Sisters, produced by Sneha Khanwalkar.\r\n“Uncle Ji” from the film Mister Mummy.\r\n“Ye Luthrey” for Sharmaji Namkeen.\r\n“Jorr” featured in Undekhi Season 3 on Sony LIV\r\n\r\n<p><iframe width=\"100%\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/qepJUGdt5Vc?si=jaypWCKcDN9q9IAc\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen=\"\"></iframe></p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p><iframe width=\"100%\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/a2hCCt3WTm4?si=ZET3Y6sLlZArsye7\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen=\"\"></iframe></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br></p><iframe width=\"100%\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/FAtUHSNYhaI\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture\" allowfullscreen=\"\"></iframe>\r\n<iframe width=\"100%\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/qft1g2ugoBk\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture\" allowfullscreen=\"\"></iframe></p><p><br></p>',	NULL,	NULL,	NULL,	NULL,	'1',	'2022-06-23 12:39:02',	'2025-06-06 04:03:31',	'Piyush-LazerX',	'Lazer X | Music Production & Sound Engineering in Punjab',	'Music Production & Sound Engineering in Punjab',	'<p>Explore the journey of Lazer X, a leading artist in music production &amp; sound engineering in Punjab. From local roots to Hollywood’s Monkey Man &amp; Bollywood projects!</p>',	3.00),
